                    The best <strong class="text-white">asphalt sealer for a driveway</strong> is the one matched to your surface and your climate, not the one with the boldest claim on the pail. Confirm the product is formulated for asphalt, compare solids content rather than price, and pick a filled or unfilled finish deliberately.
                  </p>
